  "description": "Provider-neutral .NET library for OpenAI, Anthropic Claude, Google Gemini, xAI Grok, DeepSeek, and Perplexity. Provides text and multimodal completions, streaming, reasoning, structured output, token usage, context recovery, ordered function-call batches with sequential or bounded-parallel handler execution, and optional OpenAI/Gemini image generation and editing. Targets .NET Standard 2.1.",
  "id": "Mythosia.AI",
