  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v7.0.0 is a breaking major release. Adds current OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, and xAI model contracts; provider-neutral image generation/editing; and ordered multi-function batches with sequential or bounded-parallel local handler execution. Strengthens terminal-response, continuation, refusal, malformed-tool, and usage handling across providers. Removes the legacy image methods, message-count windowing, unsafe function-message removal, retired model constants, GrokReasoning.Off, and single-function custom-provider extension signatures. Requires Mythosia.AI.Abstractions v3.0.0. Full notes and migration guide: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/core/Mythosia.AI/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v700",
